Package: geotessera
Title: Read 'Tessera' Embeddings from 'Zarr' Stores
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Anil", "Madhavapeddy", , "anil@recoil.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Reads embeddings of the 'Tessera' Earth observation
    foundation model from local or remote 'Zarr' v3 stores. Samples points, reads
    regions and fixed-size patches on native UTM grids, and exports GeoTIFF
    files.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/ucam-eo/geotessera-r, https://geotessera.org
BugReports: https://github.com/ucam-eo/geotessera-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4)
